# Aida's Prints

This is Sadia Akber's simple static website (HTML and CSS only). Talk to Sadia in plain English. Her son Aqeel helps with new accounts and bigger decisions.

## Do

- Edit `index.html`, `makes.html`, `about.html`, and `styles.css`.
- Put new pictures in `photos/` then add a `<figure>` on `makes.html`.
- Keep type large, contrast high, and pages short.
- Contact on the site is phone 0433 77 4396 only. ABN 43 568 151 482.
- Publish with GitHub + Cloudflare Pages to aidasprints.com.au.

## Don't

- Don't add React, npm, a shop, email, or extra accounts.
- If Sadia wants new systems or a bigger scope, ask her to check with Aqeel first.
